## Currency Formatter
```dart
String formatRupiah(int amount) {
  final formatted = amount.toString().replaceAllMapped(
    RegExp(r'(\d{1,3})(?=(\d{3})+(?!\d))'),
    (m) => '${m[1]}.',
  );
  return 'Rp $formatted';
}
// formatRupiah(1250000) → "Rp 1.250.000"
// formatRupiah(3251606) → "Rp 3.251.606"
```

