### go_router splash route — `router.dart`
```dart
final router = GoRouter(
  initialLocation: '/splash',
  routes: [
    GoRoute(path: '/splash', builder: (_, __) => const SplashPage()),
    ShellRoute(
      builder: (context, state, child) => MainShell(child: child),
      routes: [
        GoRoute(path: '/home',    builder: (_, __) => const HomePage()),
        GoRoute(path: '/add',     builder: (_, __) => const AddTransactionPage()),
        GoRoute(path: '/history', builder: (_, __) => const HistoryPage()),
        GoRoute(path: '/report',  builder: (_, __) => const ReportPage()),
      ],
    ),
  ],
);
```

---

### Home Page
- AppBar: large title "Saku", actions: [settings icon]
- BalanceCard: full width, black bg, white text, shows total balance + income/expense row
- Section: "Recent Transactions" → last 5 transactions using TransactionItem
- FAB: black circular "+" → open Add Transaction modal

### Add Transaction Page
- showModalBottomSheet(isScrollControlled: true)
- SegmentedButton: Expense | Income
- Large amount display "Rp 0" → custom numeric keypad on tap
- Category grid: 3 columns, selected = black background
- Date picker: showDatePicker()
- Notes: TextField single line
- Save button: full-width black ElevatedButton
- Validate: amount > 0 and category selected

### History Page
- AppBar: large title "History"
- MonthSelector: "< May 2024 >" arrows
- SegmentedButton: All | Income | Expense
- SectionList grouped by date with daily totals
- Dismissible rows for swipe-to-delete

### Report Page
- AppBar: large title "Report"
- MonthSelector at top
- Summary row: Total Income | Total Expense
- BarChart (fl_chart): daily spending, black bars
- Category breakdown: icon + label + amount + LinearProgressIndicator (black fill)
- Bottom: Net Balance bold

